
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Doctor
    participant Page as Doctor Appointments Page
    participant Loader as Doctor Appointments Data Loader
    participant Auth as Authentication
    participant Repo as Appointment Repository
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Doctor->>Page: Open My Appointments
    Page->>Loader: Load appointment information

    Loader->>Auth: requireRole doctor

    alt User is not an authorized doctor
        Auth-->>Doctor: Redirect to login or appropriate dashboard

    else Doctor is authorized
        Auth-->>Loader: Access granted

        Loader->>Loader: Get doctor ID from session

        alt Valid doctor session
            Loader->>Repo: getDoctorAppointments(doctorId)

            Repo->>DB: SELECT confirmed appointments for doctor
            DB-->>Repo: Appointment records
            Repo-->>Loader: Doctor appointment list

            Loader-->>Page: Appointment information

            alt Appointments found
                Page-->>Doctor: Display patient name, date, time and reference

            else No confirmed appointments
                Page-->>Doctor: Display no appointments message
            end

        else Invalid doctor session
            Loader-->>Page: Return session error
            Page-->>Doctor: Display error message
        end
    end

    Note over Doctor,Page: Doctor has read-only access
    Note over Repo,DB: No appointment update or cancellation
